  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">WWF - Children&apos;s Christmas Calendar 2023-2026 &quot;Welcome to the Green School&quot;</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall goal of the project is to build the resilience of children and youth in the Rwenzori sub-landscape to cope with climate change by practicing sustainable resource management and becoming agents of change for nature and climate. Through promotion of Green Schools, the &apos;Welcome to the Green School&apos; project will mainstream learning on climate change mitigation and adaptation in school curricula and create a social space in which children and youth learn to assert their agency as environmental activists and practitioners &#x2013; within their communities and more broadly in Uganda</narrative>
  </description>
